00:29:20.935 --> 00:29:22.385
They want to make sure
that every young person

00:29:22.385 --> 00:29:25.045
has a good education and
can meet their potential.

00:29:25.045 --> 00:29:27.317
And it's a real pleasure.

00:29:27.317 --> 00:29:28.935
I was trained originally as a lawyer.

00:29:28.935 --> 00:29:30.625
So I conceptualize every meeting

00:29:30.625 --> 00:29:31.905
with Bill Gates is a little bit

00:29:31.905 --> 00:29:33.515
